WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,960
what do you do

2
00:00:02,270 --> 00:00:03,390
What are you doing standing in front of my house?

3
00:00:03,950 --> 00:00:04,950
I'm looking for Wu Rumei

4
00:00:05,270 --> 00:00:06,750
I was entrusted by Fang

5
00:00:06,750 --> 00:00:08,070
She wants to find her parents

6
00:00:08,620 --> 00:00:09,860
What nonsense are you talking about?

7
00:00:10,860 --> 00:00:12,060
I can really see her

8
00:00:12,300 --> 00:00:13,900
She just wants to go home and take a look now

9
00:00:14,340 --> 00:00:15,460
I got it from Lao Li’s mouth

10
00:00:15,460 --> 00:00:16,540
I know your home address

11
00:00:16,980 --> 00:00:18,500
I don't know if what you said is true or false

12
00:00:18,660 --> 00:00:19,660
But you mentioned Uncle Li

13
00:00:19,660 --> 00:00:20,620
I give her a face

14
00:00:20,620 --> 00:00:22,620
I let you see my mother but there are two things

15
00:00:22,780 --> 00:00:24,660
First, don’t mention even a single word.

16
00:00:24,820 --> 00:00:33,290
Second, you can only stay for ten minutes. Who will listen to you?

17
00:00:34,020 --> 00:00:36,100
Is that you underneath? She can't see it

18
00:00:36,380 --> 00:00:37,620
But she knows better than anyone else

19
00:00:38,880 --> 00:00:40,560
do you know a girl

20
00:00:40,840 --> 00:00:43,600
Call her Fang Xia. I know her and she is my friend.

21
00:00:43,880 --> 00:00:45,880
Then why didn't she go home? Where is she now?

22
00:00:45,880 --> 00:00:47,960
Why don't you contact your family? Auntie, please wait a moment.

23
00:00:47,960 --> 00:00:49,000
I'm going to make a call

24
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:50,000
See if she is busy now

25
00:00:50,120 --> 00:00:51,800
Should I tell her the truth?

26
00:00:52,080 --> 00:00:53,440
Don't tell her I'm dead

27
00:00:53,840 --> 00:00:55,720
I don't want them to feel sorry for me anymore

28
00:00:55,840 --> 00:00:57,240
I have two more things to ask you for

29
00:00:57,240 --> 00:00:58,400
Heal my mother's eyes

30
00:00:58,400 --> 00:00:59,960
And find out how I died

31
00:01:00,280 --> 00:01:01,480
You are my sister-in-law

32
00:01:01,600 --> 00:01:03,440
Now we want to bear your burden

33
00:01:03,440 --> 00:01:04,760
Let her call her mother

34
00:01:04,760 --> 00:01:05,800
I just don’t know how busy this is

35
00:01:05,800 --> 00:01:06,720
Are you willing to help?

36
00:01:06,920 --> 00:01:08,440
Mom treats me like my wife and daughter

37
00:01:08,720 --> 00:01:10,040
I am willing to help my sister-in-law

38
00:01:10,040 --> 00:01:11,520
Sister-in-law, just sit by the bed

39
00:01:11,520 --> 00:01:15,860
I didn't bring the incense burner. Come on, don't cry.

40
00:01:16,060 --> 00:01:17,580
Your mother becomes more worried when she cries

41
00:01:18,660 --> 00:01:20,420
Mom, I'm having a good time

42
00:01:20,420 --> 00:01:21,460
Don't worry about it

43
00:01:21,900 --> 00:01:22,820
I'm married

44
00:01:22,820 --> 00:01:28,920
I have a baby, it’s too far away to come back, Xiaotie, thank you

45
00:01:29,240 --> 00:01:30,320
Don't know she's there either

46
00:01:30,320 --> 00:01:31,360
how are you doing

47
00:01:31,520 --> 00:01:32,600
She is doing well now

48
00:01:32,600 --> 00:01:33,800
Didn’t you say you already had a baby?

49
00:01:33,800 --> 00:01:34,720
she is dead

50
00:01:34,800 --> 00:01:36,280
The soul is floating outside

51
00:01:36,400 --> 00:01:39,800
How can I have a good life? What are you talking about?

52
00:01:40,160 --> 00:01:41,760
Didn't you just hear her voice?

53
00:01:41,760 --> 00:01:43,080
He would have died long ago

54
00:01:43,400 --> 00:01:44,840
died thirty years ago

55
00:01:44,840 --> 00:01:46,200
Guess how I know

56
00:01:46,680 --> 00:01:49,280
Because I personally killed Fang Xia
